WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:33.138
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:33.408 --> 00:34.652
Who was it?

3
00:35.320 --> 00:37.328
I said, who was it!

4
00:40.380 --> 00:42.167
Was it you?

5
00:42.167 --> 00:43.979
Was it you? Kim Jin Mi, answer.

6
00:43.979 --> 00:46.993
- It's not that... - Answer me!

7
00:46.993 --> 00:48.840
It's fine, Yu Gyeom...

8
00:48.840 --> 00:51.178
I asked you a question, Kim Jin Mi.

9
00:51.980 --> 00:53.086
Well, I...

10
00:53.086 --> 00:55.260
I wanted Sung Sae Ryeong...

11
00:55.260 --> 00:57.212
She's the one I called over...

12
00:57.900 --> 01:01.456
So you meant to do this to Sae Ryeong?

13
01:01.456 --> 01:02.489
Why?

14
01:02.489 --> 01:04.429
Because we broke up?

15
01:04.429 --> 01:07.636
You're so low, it makes me sick.

16
01:07.636 --> 01:09.063
I'm sorry!

17
01:09.063 --> 01:11.176
This was stupid of me.

18
01:11.176 --> 01:13.446
But Sung Sae Ryeong was horrible to us!

19
01:13.446 --> 01:14.722
That's why we did it.

20
01:14.722 --> 01:18.484
So, your girlfriend... was never meant to be the target!

21
01:18.484 --> 01:20.502
I'm so sorry!

22
01:20.502 --> 01:22.661
And she can wash it off, you know!

23
01:22.661 --> 01:24.742
It'll come right off.

24
01:26.316 --> 01:27.938
Wash it off?

25
01:28.976 --> 01:31.569
- I'll take her and get it off right now! - Jin Mi.

26
01:31.569 --> 01:33.115
Give me your phone.

27
01:35.376 --> 01:37.469
M-My phone?

28
01:37.469 --> 01:40.112
Do I have to pry it from you, or will you give it over?

29
01:50.736 --> 01:52.273
What did you just do?

30
01:52.273 --> 01:53.697
What's wrong? You can just fix it.

31
01:53.697 --> 01:55.648
Just like she can wash it off.

32
02:01.249 --> 02:02.969
Hey, Cho Yu Gyeom.

33
02:02.969 --> 02:04.207
Go ahead.

34
02:04.207 --> 02:07.032
You don't know when to stop, do you?

35
02:07.763 --> 02:10.773
I was used and abused by Sung Sae Ryeong!

36
02:10.773 --> 02:13.229
I was basically her servant for four years!

37
02:13.229 --> 02:15.686
She was a monster!

38
02:15.686 --> 02:17.417
And you dated her, didn't you?

39
02:17.417 --> 02:20.909
You know what a witch she is!

40
02:20.909 --> 02:23.846
I'm sorry for what I did to your current girlfriend,

41
02:23.846 --> 02:26.430
but you're going too far!

42
02:26.430 --> 02:29.247
Let's be honest, you dated Sae Ryeong and Ha Yeon at the same time,

43
02:29.247 --> 02:32.089
and look where it got all of us!

44
02:32.089 --> 02:33.416
Hey!

45
02:33.416 --> 02:34.806
You know what my mom said?

46
02:34.806 --> 02:36.489
That's what happened with your family.

47
02:36.489 --> 02:38.540
Everyone in this town knows how it goes.

48
02:38.540 --> 02:40.452
You and your sisters are from different lovers!

49
02:40.452 --> 02:42.215
Kim Jin Mi.

50
02:45.730 --> 02:48.299
I heard you smell like rotten fish.

51
02:49.711 --> 02:51.634
- What? - Your boyfriend...

52
02:51.634 --> 02:53.522
Lee Won Bae told me.

53
02:57.856 --> 02:59.012
What?

54
02:59.012 --> 03:00.708
Jin Mi.

55
03:01.503 --> 03:03.130
We're all trash.

56
03:04.023 --> 03:06.436
A heap of trash that only gets worse the deeper you dig.

57
03:06.436 --> 03:08.513
We stink like hell.

58
03:09.516 --> 03:11.024
Well...

59
03:11.024 --> 03:13.172
The stench isn't the worst of it.

60
03:15.163 --> 03:17.590
And yet...

61
03:17.590 --> 03:21.243
we all go on pretending we're not. So why can't you?

62
03:21.243 --> 03:25.622
I don't understand why... you want to prove that we are all trash!

63
03:25.622 --> 03:27.191
You hear me? We're trash!

64
03:27.191 --> 03:30.461
You're rotten fish, and I'm dust from a wrecked home!

65
03:35.790 --> 03:39.099
Is this... what you wanted to hear?

66
04:04.110 --> 04:05.134
[Namsu - Upo - Upo CC]

67
04:05.134 --> 04:09.230
[5. Road Bound Home]

68
04:09.230 --> 04:10.745
[Episode 5]

69
04:15.339 --> 04:18.363
In my family, only Mom is mine.

70
04:18.363 --> 04:19.820
That's what happened with your family.

71
04:19.820 --> 04:22.702
You and your sisters are from different lovers!

72
04:33.543 --> 04:35.609
You don't smell.

73
04:35.609 --> 04:37.402
Really, you don't.

74
04:37.402 --> 04:38.703
But...

75
04:38.703 --> 04:40.390
I keep smelling something.

76
04:40.390 --> 04:41.905
I can't smell it at all.

77
04:42.876 --> 04:44.618
Really?

78
04:44.618 --> 04:45.784
Yeah.

79
04:46.745 --> 04:48.299
Are you okay?

80
04:50.457 --> 04:53.783
I think I should be the one asking that.

81
04:53.783 --> 04:55.676
Of course I'm fine.

82
04:57.464 --> 04:58.994
Yeah. I'm fine.

83
05:00.216 --> 05:04.830
I had no idea what you meant about your mom.

84
05:06.723 --> 05:08.722
Nobody does, at first.

85
05:09.370 --> 05:10.734
It's okay.

86
05:12.923 --> 05:14.989
Why are you looking at me like that?

87
05:14.989 --> 05:16.982
It's just fascinating.

88
05:16.982 --> 05:18.607
What is?

89
05:20.503 --> 05:22.103
Actually...

90
05:22.103 --> 05:25.835
I've always wanted to be a protagonist with a mysterious past.

91
05:25.835 --> 05:27.158
What?

92
05:29.890 --> 05:32.510
My mom's just straight-up evil.

93
05:32.510 --> 05:35.729
So I'd often wish she wasn't my real mom.

94
05:36.423 --> 05:39.756
Every family has at least one evil person.

95
05:39.756 --> 05:42.543
- Does yours have one, too? - Of course we do.

96
05:43.896 --> 05:45.887
I...

97
05:45.887 --> 05:48.167
absolutely despise my mom.

98
05:48.167 --> 05:49.523
Why?

99
05:49.523 --> 05:50.690
Just because.

100
05:50.690 --> 05:52.888
I don't want to end up like her.

101
05:54.503 --> 05:57.941
I'm scared of becoming my dad, too.

102
05:59.500 --> 06:01.200
What about movies?

103
06:02.940 --> 06:05.267
Do you like movies?

104
06:06.593 --> 06:08.320
I do.

105
06:08.320 --> 06:09.580
Me too.

106
06:09.580 --> 06:11.540
I like them too.

107
06:11.540 --> 06:13.600
What is this?

108
06:13.600 --> 06:15.430
Things we have in common.

109
06:16.210 --> 06:17.313
What?

110
06:17.313 --> 06:19.840
Things we have in common!

111
06:19.840 --> 06:21.740
You're cute.

112
06:21.740 --> 06:24.213
I didn't start it, okay?

113
06:24.213 --> 06:26.565
She's the one who started it!

114
06:27.600 --> 06:29.710
I'm not lying!

115
06:37.720 --> 06:38.726
Hey.

116
06:38.726 --> 06:41.233
She's a minor, you hear? A minor!

117
06:41.233 --> 06:42.966
Legally underage!

118
06:42.966 --> 06:45.380
Do you miss being in prison?

119
06:45.380 --> 06:47.840
You just got out. Already at it again?

120
06:47.840 --> 06:49.197
I told you already.

121
06:49.197 --> 06:50.946
It wasn't my fault!

122
06:50.946 --> 06:53.830
The tramp approached me first, I swear!

123
06:53.830 --> 06:55.606
Hey, you.

124
06:55.606 --> 06:57.750
One more strike, and you're out.

125
06:57.750 --> 06:58.961
Damn it...

126
06:58.961 --> 07:01.204
But I swear it wasn't me, I...

127
07:02.626 --> 07:04.341
I'm sure you know what happens after strike three.

128
07:04.341 --> 07:06.267
You have to believe me.

129
07:06.267 --> 07:08.953
Please, you have to believe me!

130
07:08.953 --> 07:11.421
You can't believe someone you don't trust.

131
07:12.745 --> 07:14.000
Got it?

132
07:15.186 --> 07:17.100
I have three sisters.

133
07:17.100 --> 07:19.033
Not one?

134
07:19.033 --> 07:20.326
Yeah.

135
07:20.326 --> 07:21.600
Three.

136
07:21.600 --> 07:24.833
I had no idea. I only saw one of them.

137
07:24.833 --> 07:25.890
That's the third one.

138
07:25.890 --> 07:27.256
Sam Hee.

139
07:28.113 --> 07:29.766
And?

140
07:29.766 --> 07:32.005
The first one got married.

141
07:33.013 --> 07:35.580
What about the middle one?

142
07:35.580 --> 07:37.491
I don't know. She ran away.

143
07:38.193 --> 07:40.380
- Hello, miss! - Good morning, miss!

144
07:40.380 --> 07:41.917
She's somewhere, at least.

145
07:44.130 --> 07:46.413
- Morning, miss! - Hello, miss!

146
07:54.013 --> 07:55.380
Hey, boss.

147
07:55.380 --> 07:57.004
She says she didn't get any money yesterday.

148
07:57.004 --> 08:00.122
She left early because of her period cramps.

149
08:11.846 --> 08:13.226
You, girl.

150
08:13.226 --> 08:14.946
Give me the phone number.

151
08:14.946 --> 08:15.971
Pardon me?

152
08:15.971 --> 08:17.277
What number?

153
08:17.277 --> 08:19.666
The guy who runs the place you worked at.

154
08:19.666 --> 08:20.998
Spit it out.

155
08:22.261 --> 08:23.361
That's...

156
08:23.361 --> 08:24.703
Hey!

157
08:24.703 --> 08:26.931
You did work, right?

158
08:26.931 --> 08:29.336
You should get paid for every hour you worked.

159
08:29.336 --> 08:31.664
Cutting it short doesn't mean you shouldn't get paid.

160
08:32.633 --> 08:33.873
Hey.

161
08:33.873 --> 08:36.849
I'll call the owner for you, so give me the number.

162
08:37.740 --> 08:39.023
Come on!

163
08:42.653 --> 08:44.464
I asked for a number, not money.

164
08:44.464 --> 08:46.447
Whatever!

165
08:48.820 --> 08:50.400
Unbelievable!

166
08:51.733 --> 08:55.385
Kids these days, lying through their teeth!

167
08:56.906 --> 08:57.993
Hey!

168
08:57.993 --> 09:00.290
How did you know she was lying?

169
09:00.290 --> 09:02.130
She almost fooled me!

170
09:05.170 --> 09:06.922
Hey.

171
09:06.922 --> 09:08.805
She says she's new.

172
09:12.302 --> 09:15.430
I heard you can help minors get jobs.

173
09:15.430 --> 09:17.208
I need to make money.

174
09:19.103 --> 09:20.602
Hey, girl.

175
09:20.602 --> 09:22.994
We can help, but...

176
09:22.994 --> 09:24.430
[Sung Sae Ryeong] Lots.

177
09:24.430 --> 09:26.303
Lots and lots of money.

178
09:26.303 --> 09:28.167
I'll take any kind of job.

179
09:28.167 --> 09:31.292
I just need it to pay well.

180
09:31.292 --> 09:32.316
You'll do anything?

181
09:32.316 --> 09:34.107
Yes, anything at all.

182
09:34.107 --> 09:35.271
Everything.

183
09:35.271 --> 09:38.537
I hope you don't have the wrong idea.

184
09:38.537 --> 09:40.289
Let me just say...

185
09:41.830 --> 09:44.438
Even really shady stuff is fine.

186
09:48.172 --> 09:49.623
Crazy.

187
09:51.510 --> 09:52.634
Why are you laughing?

188
09:52.634 --> 09:54.167
I'm desperate.

189
09:55.616 --> 09:57.210
I know.

190
09:57.210 --> 09:59.316
We know how you feel, but...

191
10:02.843 --> 10:04.516
Hey.

192
10:04.516 --> 10:06.676
Do you have a place to stay?

193
10:06.676 --> 10:10.763
We get so many runaways here. It's blatantly obvious.

194
10:10.763 --> 10:12.103
Hey, Jeong Min!

195
10:12.103 --> 10:15.210
Call Mi Young and get this girl a room.

196
10:17.170 --> 10:18.202
And you.

197
10:18.202 --> 10:21.150
I'll be in touch, so stay there and don't go anywhere.

198
10:21.150 --> 10:22.710
Got it?

199
10:22.710 --> 10:24.558
Yeah, sure.

200
10:25.292 --> 10:26.632
Follow me.

201
10:31.757 --> 10:33.323
Hey.

202
10:33.323 --> 10:34.396
What was that about?

203
10:34.396 --> 10:36.856
Why are we putting her on hold?

204
10:36.856 --> 10:41.396
Don't tell me you're actually considering pimping her!

205
10:41.396 --> 10:43.260
She's pretty, sure, but that's...

206
10:43.260 --> 10:46.122
That's just wrong! She's a high schooler! Hey!

207
10:56.043 --> 11:01.636
[Dul Hee: Sam Hee, do you know Sung Sae Ryeong from Upo High?]

208
11:01.636 --> 11:05.847
[Sure I do. She's Yu Gyeom's girlfriend.]

209
11:54.870 --> 11:57.323
You can drop me off over there.

210
12:06.289 --> 12:09.540
I'm sorry for that.

211
12:09.540 --> 12:11.840
I was on my phone.

212
12:12.690 --> 12:16.576
And, well... about the tutoring, you know...

213
12:16.576 --> 12:18.714
I'm not really experienced,

214
12:18.714 --> 12:23.202
and you can learn sign language by watching videos at home.

215
12:23.202 --> 12:26.004
There's really no need for lessons.

216
12:27.456 --> 12:29.977
I thought I could just memorize it, too.

217
12:31.919 --> 12:34.379
But it's too fast.

218
12:34.379 --> 12:35.802
I can't follow.

219
12:37.016 --> 12:40.171
Well, you should ask them to slow down for you.

220
12:40.171 --> 12:42.544
I want to understand it all.

221
12:42.544 --> 12:44.656
But none of the videos I found

222
12:44.656 --> 12:47.303
showed anyone using sign language that fast.

223
12:47.303 --> 12:48.369
Well, yeah.

224
12:48.369 --> 12:51.974
I just think that's how teaching works.

225
12:51.974 --> 12:53.511
Just ask the other person to...

226
12:53.511 --> 12:55.767
But you were fast enough.

227
12:57.063 --> 12:59.002
- Me? - Yes, you.

228
13:00.822 --> 13:03.353
Don't think too hard about it.

229
13:05.368 --> 13:10.749
Just talk to me in sign language, and I'll try to understand you.

230
13:10.749 --> 13:12.014
That's all.

231
13:12.014 --> 13:13.100
And...

232
13:13.100 --> 13:16.000
There's no need to slow down for me.

233
13:16.000 --> 13:18.274
I don't want you to teach me, either.

234
13:18.274 --> 13:20.574
Just make conversation with me.

235
13:20.574 --> 13:24.265
In time, I believe I'll get used to it.

236
13:27.940 --> 13:32.934
If it's the tutoring part that scares you, we can be friends.

237
13:32.934 --> 13:36.553
- Just use sign language with me, and-- - I'd like to be friends!

238
13:41.047 --> 13:42.444
"Can do."

239
13:43.374 --> 13:44.759
"Not hard?"

240
13:47.114 --> 13:49.001
Yeah, friends.

241
13:50.874 --> 13:52.107
Thanks.

242
13:54.980 --> 13:56.387
I'll see you tomorrow if possible.

243
13:56.387 --> 13:57.839
I'll be in touch.

244
14:11.810 --> 14:13.340
I need to go.

245
14:16.856 --> 14:18.420
[Upo-ri Police Substation]

246
14:26.115 --> 14:29.883
I-I don't understand!

247
14:31.370 --> 14:32.907
Ma'am.

248
14:32.907 --> 14:34.327
Could you write it down for us?

249
14:34.327 --> 14:37.668
I'm sorry, but no one here knows sign language.

250
14:37.668 --> 14:39.504
I don't know!

251
14:39.504 --> 14:41.089
I don't understand what you're saying!

252
14:41.089 --> 14:42.958
This is driving me mad!

253
14:42.958 --> 14:44.708
- Sir. - What do we do?

254
14:44.708 --> 14:46.912
Should we see if there are any interpreters in town?

255
14:46.912 --> 14:48.262
Or we could call 110...

256
14:48.262 --> 14:49.939
Yes, yes!

257
14:51.887 --> 14:53.726
J-Just a minute, please!

258
14:53.726 --> 14:54.807
Oh my.

259
14:54.807 --> 14:56.294
Madam!

260
14:56.294 --> 14:57.908
Is something the matter?

261
15:00.500 --> 15:02.108
Hello to you too.

262
15:05.822 --> 15:06.990
"Gone?"

263
15:06.990 --> 15:08.696
Who's gone?

264
15:09.527 --> 15:10.615
Who?

265
15:11.480 --> 15:13.109
Sae Ryeong?

266
15:16.291 --> 15:18.640
Are you feeling ill, Jin Mi?

267
15:20.767 --> 15:22.837
Hey, Jin Mi...

268
15:25.886 --> 15:28.745
Come on, stop crying.

269
15:28.745 --> 15:31.658
Yeah, cut it out already.

270
15:34.360 --> 15:37.427
Come on, Jin Mi, talk to me.

271
15:42.460 --> 15:45.499
Jin Mi cried the whole day.

272
15:49.927 --> 15:53.115
She kept her head down through every class since yesterday.

273
15:57.930 --> 16:01.997
She neither eats nor goes to the restroom.

274
16:01.997 --> 16:03.119
Ha Yeon.

275
16:04.637 --> 16:07.814
Do you think I'm in the wrong here?

276
16:11.530 --> 16:12.739
No.

277
16:14.237 --> 16:16.282
But you did go too far.

278
16:18.686 --> 16:22.370
She shouldn't have done that to me,

279
16:22.370 --> 16:24.397
but you shouldn't have done that to her, either.

280
16:28.497 --> 16:32.302
I... get angry, sometimes.

281
16:37.023 --> 16:39.834
I don't want to be here, either.

282
16:39.834 --> 16:42.063
We have no other choice. Let's go back inside.

283
16:42.063 --> 16:44.296
Hey! Babe!

284
16:44.296 --> 16:46.100
Damn!

285
16:46.100 --> 16:48.104
I told you not to swear!

286
16:48.104 --> 16:49.464
I'm leaving.

287
16:49.464 --> 16:51.087
I'd rather die than live like Mom!

288
16:51.087 --> 16:52.293
Is that what you call living?

289
16:52.293 --> 16:54.608
You have no damn pride or self-respect!

290
16:56.225 --> 16:58.531
What are you doing?

291
17:00.733 --> 17:04.184
You need to calm down! What's wrong with you?

292
17:04.184 --> 17:05.601
Let her go.

293
17:05.601 --> 17:10.118
A beautiful, comfy garden is no use if the flower doesn't want to be there.

294
17:14.347 --> 17:16.526
Just let her leave!

295
17:24.120 --> 17:25.336
Dul Hee...

296
17:26.560 --> 17:27.861
Dul Hee!

297
17:29.047 --> 17:30.867
Sister...

298
17:30.867 --> 17:33.507
I guess it's an insecurity of mine.

299
17:33.507 --> 17:35.184
Whenever my belief that I've been

300
17:35.184 --> 17:38.200
doing well to protect something so very dear to me...

301
17:38.200 --> 17:40.396
gets proven otherwise...

302
17:42.040 --> 17:44.653
Whenever I find out that I...

303
17:44.653 --> 17:47.602
never had the power to protect anything in the first place.

304
17:49.027 --> 17:50.224
No.

305
17:51.083 --> 17:53.917
You protected me well enough.

306
17:53.917 --> 17:56.579
You had the power to do so. I mean it.

307
17:58.717 --> 17:59.858
Alright.

308
18:02.283 --> 18:04.457
I'll apologize.

309
18:04.457 --> 18:05.845
Really?

310
18:06.883 --> 18:09.893
I've never done it before, but...

311
18:11.457 --> 18:14.563
You really are going to apologize to Jin Mi?

312
18:14.563 --> 18:15.923
I will. You were right.

313
18:15.923 --> 18:17.610
I went too far.

314
18:17.610 --> 18:19.453
I'll try apologizing.

315
18:19.453 --> 18:21.737
Wow.

316
18:21.737 --> 18:24.357
Does that make you happy?

317
18:24.357 --> 18:26.517
Yes, it does.

318
18:26.517 --> 18:28.225
I don't see why.

319
18:30.863 --> 18:34.894
Well, in movies, a cool male lead

320
18:34.894 --> 18:40.361
sometimes does things he'd never do for an ordinary female lead.

321
18:41.371 --> 18:43.397
For example,

322
18:43.397 --> 18:47.596
a guy who never drives suddenly starts driving for the girl.

323
18:47.596 --> 18:49.563
Stuff like that.

324
18:49.563 --> 18:52.183
You know what I thought when I saw that?

325
18:55.869 --> 18:57.794
That makes no damn sense at all.

326
18:59.997 --> 19:02.414
That man is so stunning.

327
19:02.414 --> 19:08.397
Why would he change himself for such an insignificant woman?

328
19:10.050 --> 19:12.470
It just isn't realistic at all.

329
19:13.917 --> 19:18.700
Maybe that woman wasn't insignificant at all.

330
19:22.196 --> 19:23.566
You're right.

331
19:24.457 --> 19:28.880
That's exactly how you made me feel just now.

332
19:36.237 --> 19:38.748
I thought I was like a kettle.

333
19:41.430 --> 19:43.659
Like some faded curtains,

334
19:45.017 --> 19:48.169
or an old clock that no one looks at.

335
19:52.063 --> 19:54.954
But ever since I met you here...

336
19:55.950 --> 19:58.970
I feel like I'm the protagonist of a movie.

337
19:58.970 --> 20:00.396
All thanks to you.

338
20:02.050 --> 20:03.563
It's an honor.

339
20:03.563 --> 20:05.214
If I'm being honest,

340
20:05.214 --> 20:09.663
I never even felt like the protagonist of my own life.

341
20:09.663 --> 20:14.270
Even my name is plain. I've had several classmates with the same name.

342
20:15.464 --> 20:17.072
I beg to differ.

343
20:19.337 --> 20:20.521
What do you mean?

344
20:21.163 --> 20:23.283
Kim Ha Yeon. Your name.

345
20:23.283 --> 20:25.092
You're the first Ha Yeon I've ever met.

346
20:27.043 --> 20:30.463
Everything about you is a first for me.

347
20:41.543 --> 20:44.710
We only have two weeks left.

348
20:44.710 --> 20:45.855
Of what?

349
20:46.530 --> 20:47.984
Summer vacation.

350
20:52.803 --> 20:55.207
Mom! I finished up over there. What should I do now?

351
20:55.207 --> 20:56.710
You can give me anything to do.

352
20:56.710 --> 21:00.230
I've got plenty of time before I go play Korean chess with grandpa.

353
21:00.230 --> 21:01.550
It's alright.

354
21:01.550 --> 21:03.563
I've just finished up, too.

355
21:05.530 --> 21:07.350
What's going on?

356
21:07.350 --> 21:09.686
You seem excited.

357
21:09.686 --> 21:11.605
No, it's nothing.

358
21:11.605 --> 21:13.439
Sam Hee, did you hear?

359
21:13.439 --> 21:17.376
Sae Ryeong ran away.

360
21:18.010 --> 21:21.194
I found out when I stopped by the precinct to drop off some beverages.

361
21:21.194 --> 21:24.402
Her grandmother was there to file a report.

362
21:25.270 --> 21:26.394
The police...

363
21:26.394 --> 21:30.493
They said they couldn't do anything if she left on her own.

364
21:31.990 --> 21:34.314
But she's so young, I'm worried.

365
21:34.314 --> 21:35.837
So...

366
21:35.837 --> 21:37.050
Well...

367
21:37.050 --> 21:38.881
- Mom? - Yes?

368
21:38.881 --> 21:40.056
What is it?

369
21:40.870 --> 21:42.095
It's just...

370
21:43.603 --> 21:45.488
Sister asked me about Sae Ryeong.

371
21:48.237 --> 21:49.821
Who? What?

372
21:51.230 --> 21:52.315
My sister.

373
21:55.783 --> 21:57.201
Do you mean...

374
21:57.907 --> 21:59.846
Cho Dul Hee?

375
22:08.880 --> 22:10.727
Are you keeping in contact with her?

376
22:10.727 --> 22:12.917
No, I mean, sometimes. Rarely.

377
22:12.917 --> 22:14.780
Cho Sam Hee.

378
22:14.780 --> 22:17.044
She left this house.

379
22:17.800 --> 22:20.296
Why would you keep in touch with someone like her?

380
22:22.747 --> 22:24.847
You're getting on my nerves.

381
22:31.292 --> 22:33.880
[ryu_siyeol] [Karaoke Time After So Long!]

382
22:57.709 --> 22:58.899
Hey.

383
22:59.727 --> 23:01.012
Come outside.

384
23:13.080 --> 23:14.763
Hey.

385
23:14.763 --> 23:16.709
Sister here says she knows you.

386
23:18.903 --> 23:20.122
Me?

387
23:20.783 --> 23:22.383
You know me?

388
23:23.141 --> 23:25.014
How do you know me?

389
23:26.920 --> 23:28.904
She wants to know why you ran away.

390
23:28.904 --> 23:31.468
I want to know how she knows me.

391
23:31.468 --> 23:32.520
Hey.

392
23:32.520 --> 23:34.292
Answer the question. Why did you run away?

393
23:34.292 --> 23:36.220
Tell me how she knows...

394
23:38.864 --> 23:40.984
Hey. Don't you know who I am?

395
23:44.580 --> 23:46.285
Cho Yu Gyeom?

396
23:46.285 --> 23:48.603
Just tell me already.

397
23:48.603 --> 23:51.261
Why did you leave home?

398
23:52.133 --> 23:54.564
I didn't expect to see his second older sister here.

399
23:54.564 --> 23:55.727
Your name was...

400
23:55.727 --> 23:58.077
Dul Ja, or Dul Jae, or...

401
23:58.077 --> 23:59.718
It's Dul Hee.

402
23:59.718 --> 24:01.305
Right, Dul Hee.

403
24:01.305 --> 24:02.740
Cho Dul Hee.

404
24:02.740 --> 24:05.653
It's nice to see you.

405
24:05.653 --> 24:08.700
I'm asking why you left home!

406
24:08.700 --> 24:09.724
Why?

407
24:09.724 --> 24:11.529
To make money, of course.

408
24:11.529 --> 24:13.114
Your family is rich, aren't they?

409
24:31.060 --> 24:33.627
It was all a lie.

410
24:33.627 --> 24:35.442
I got caught, so I ran away.

411
24:35.442 --> 24:36.630
What?

412
24:36.630 --> 24:41.069
So I'm looking to make money fast and easy.

413
24:41.069 --> 24:43.393
A lot of it.

414
24:43.393 --> 24:46.412
We already told you that's not how we do things here.

415
24:47.567 --> 24:49.293
Can't you just do it for me?

416
24:49.293 --> 24:51.772
As a favor between acquaintances.

417
24:51.772 --> 24:53.981
You have no status, and you're underage.

418
24:53.981 --> 24:56.427
If you want to make easy money, and fast...

419
24:59.206 --> 25:01.450
it's all illegal.

420
25:01.450 --> 25:03.873
And if you start working illegal jobs...

421
25:05.883 --> 25:10.337
Well, there's a big hospital across the intersection there.

422
25:10.337 --> 25:11.923
That's where you'll end up.

423
25:11.923 --> 25:13.337
Well...

424
25:13.337 --> 25:15.813
The ICU or the morgue, probably.

425
25:16.470 --> 25:17.470
Why?

426
25:18.303 --> 25:21.301
Because your body will be ruined in no time.

427
25:21.301 --> 25:22.459
So--

428
25:22.459 --> 25:24.542
Go home right now.

429
25:29.393 --> 25:30.820
I don't want to.

430
25:31.891 --> 25:33.070
What's the matter?

431
25:33.070 --> 25:35.013
You ran away, too, right?

432
25:36.172 --> 25:37.474
You sure are one of a kind.

433
25:37.474 --> 25:40.360
Dul Hee, what's up with this girl anyway?

434
25:40.360 --> 25:42.130
I didn't say anything wrong.

435
25:42.130 --> 25:45.190
You left your home and ended up here.

436
25:45.190 --> 25:46.997
But look where we are.

437
25:46.997 --> 25:50.497
This isn't the ICU, and it certainly isn't a morgue.

438
25:52.593 --> 25:57.804
I heard Yu Gyeom searched like a madman to find you,

439
25:57.804 --> 25:59.789
and when he did, you told him this.

440
25:59.789 --> 26:02.201
"Fuck off, you bastard!"

441
26:03.273 --> 26:06.333
You're a true hypocrite, aren't you?

442
26:06.333 --> 26:08.647
You remind me of Yu Gyeom.

443
26:08.647 --> 26:11.260
Does it run in your family or something?

444
26:11.260 --> 26:12.793
Who are you to say that?

445
26:12.793 --> 26:14.447
Who do you think you are?

446
26:14.447 --> 26:19.046
So you can't tell me what to do.

447
26:28.660 --> 26:30.280
By the way...

448
26:30.280 --> 26:33.540
I get that you won't let teenagers do anything illegal.

449
26:33.540 --> 26:34.722
But...

450
26:36.920 --> 26:39.718
I guess different rules apply to adults.

451
26:40.683 --> 26:46.070
I mean, the room that you put me in reeks of weed.

452
26:46.070 --> 26:48.543
I'm guessing you smoke weed here?

453
26:48.543 --> 26:52.410
And I've seen the women here. They obviously work in dubious places.

454
26:52.410 --> 26:57.309
I don't know if you know, but I'm very good at filing police reports.

455
27:06.458 --> 27:07.586
Yu Gyeom!

456
27:07.586 --> 27:09.893
- Leave me alone. - Yu Gyeom!

457
27:10.797 --> 27:12.020
Come on!

458
27:13.109 --> 27:14.801
Listen.

459
27:14.801 --> 27:17.219
- I just... - What is it?

460
27:17.971 --> 27:19.848
No, it's just that...

461
27:19.848 --> 27:21.309
Come with me.

462
27:22.337 --> 27:23.356
Hurry!

463
27:25.145 --> 27:26.574
Um...

464
27:26.574 --> 27:28.619
Did Sae Ryeong run away from home?

465
27:29.930 --> 27:33.612
I was just wondering if she went to Seoul.

466
27:33.612 --> 27:35.143
How would I know?

467
27:35.143 --> 27:36.330
Why not?

468
27:36.330 --> 27:38.532
Because we broke up.

469
27:38.532 --> 27:41.177
Why? Why on earth did you break up?

470
27:41.177 --> 27:43.506
Is this what you wanted me for?

471
27:44.203 --> 27:45.707
We broke up.

472
27:45.707 --> 27:46.951
And I don't care about her.

473
27:46.951 --> 27:47.983
Is that clear?

474
27:47.983 --> 27:50.416
Wait, Dul Hee texted me.

475
27:53.298 --> 27:56.260
Sae Ryeong is there with her.

476
27:56.260 --> 27:57.644
With Dul Hee.

477
27:58.824 --> 28:00.940
She wants to prostitute herself.

478
28:03.003 --> 28:04.557
What?

479
28:04.557 --> 28:07.104
[Are you deaf? Are you hard of hearing?] I'm telling you!

480
28:07.104 --> 28:09.648
She's been acting so weird lately!

481
28:10.649 --> 28:14.477
Where the hell is she now?

482
28:14.477 --> 28:17.167
She keeps going out at night!

483
28:17.167 --> 28:19.158
It's keeping me up all night!

484
28:19.158 --> 28:20.490
Kim Ha Yeon!

485
28:20.490 --> 28:21.950
Hey, Kim Ha Yeon!

486
28:23.710 --> 28:24.808
What the...

487
28:25.747 --> 28:27.117
You...

488
28:27.117 --> 28:29.027
Were you here all this time?

489
28:29.027 --> 28:30.120
Yes.

490
28:32.610 --> 28:35.211
Were you studying?

491
28:36.443 --> 28:38.087
- Yes. - See?

492
28:38.087 --> 28:40.271
I told you you were being hysterical.

493
28:40.271 --> 28:42.189
Keep at it, Ha Yeon.

494
28:42.189 --> 28:43.781
Come on, leave her alone.

495
28:48.150 --> 28:51.121
You should get off her back. You'll only stress her out.

496
28:54.630 --> 28:57.570
You never pay attention to the kids.

497
28:57.570 --> 28:59.825
I have my reasons, you know!

498
29:02.297 --> 29:03.583
Hey.

499
29:03.583 --> 29:05.763
What are you snickering at?

500
29:05.763 --> 29:06.763
What?

501
29:08.310 --> 29:09.450
Nothing.

502
29:09.450 --> 29:10.837
It's nothing.

503
29:10.837 --> 29:14.179
I'm just so touchy these days.

504
29:14.179 --> 29:15.953
Really, I just can't...

505
29:18.227 --> 29:19.328
Mom?

506
29:20.330 --> 29:22.648
May I buy a game pack?

507
29:22.648 --> 29:23.959
Sure.

508
29:23.959 --> 29:25.291
How much is it?

509
29:27.330 --> 29:28.337
300,000 won.

510
29:28.337 --> 29:31.049
[Transfer to: Noh Dae Hyeon] [Confirm]

511
29:31.049 --> 29:32.340
[Please confirm the recipient's name] [Noh Dae Hyeon]

512
29:32.340 --> 29:36.170
[Transfer 300,000 won to Noh Dae Hyeon] No one in this house ever stands up for me!

513
29:36.170 --> 29:37.982
I'm the only one who cares.

514
29:39.583 --> 29:42.779
Come on, talk to me, Jin Mi.

515
29:42.779 --> 29:46.470
How would I know what's wrong if you won't talk to me?

516
29:46.470 --> 29:49.277
What happened to you?

517
29:49.277 --> 29:51.787
It's been days now!

518
29:51.787 --> 29:53.292
Leave her alone.

519
29:53.292 --> 29:54.554
She must be on her period.

520
29:54.554 --> 29:55.911
Hey, you. She's not.

521
29:55.911 --> 29:57.430
"Hey, yew, she's nawt."

522
29:57.430 --> 29:58.561
Hey, hey!

523
29:58.561 --> 30:00.917
Surely you must know why she's doing this.

524
30:00.917 --> 30:02.901
What's up with her?

525
30:04.710 --> 30:08.034
Please, Jin Mi! Please!

526
30:08.034 --> 30:09.058
Lee Won Bae.

527
30:09.058 --> 30:10.382
Are you sure you didn't do something wrong?

528
30:10.382 --> 30:15.126
No! We haven't even seen each other recently, so how could I have done anything wrong?

529
30:15.126 --> 30:17.681
If... If I...

530
30:17.681 --> 30:20.378
If I did anything wrong, I guess it was just existing!

531
30:20.378 --> 30:22.603
- Satisfied? - What?

532
30:22.603 --> 30:24.420
So riled up.

533
30:25.170 --> 30:26.361
Yu Gyeom's here.

534
30:26.361 --> 30:27.430
Cho Yu Gyeom!

535
30:27.430 --> 30:29.187
Why, why?

536
30:29.187 --> 30:30.971
Why won't you talk to me?

537
30:30.971 --> 30:35.657
Why, why, why?

538
30:35.657 --> 30:36.681
Hey, Kim Jin Mi.

539
30:36.681 --> 30:39.031
- Why. - Cho Yu Gyeom wants to see you.

540
30:53.483 --> 30:55.449
For the phone that I broke.

541
30:55.449 --> 30:57.643
I-I'm sorry.

542
31:00.310 --> 31:01.457
I'm sorry.

543
31:01.457 --> 31:03.897
I went too far.

544
31:03.897 --> 31:07.791
I'm sorry for yelling and taking my anger out on you.

545
31:08.958 --> 31:11.357
I'm sorry. I mean it.

546
31:11.357 --> 31:13.610
No, it's fine.

547
31:13.610 --> 31:15.879
Thank you for accepting my apology.

548
31:16.930 --> 31:18.897
It's nothing...

549
31:18.897 --> 31:21.659
But I think you should apologize too, when you get the chance.

550
31:22.923 --> 31:24.217
Right.

551
31:24.217 --> 31:25.921
I'm sorry to you, too, for--

552
31:25.921 --> 31:27.503
No, not to me.

553
31:27.503 --> 31:29.128
To Kim Ha Yeon.

554
31:29.128 --> 31:30.216
Kim Ha Yeon?

555
31:30.216 --> 31:32.775
You dumped dirty water on her.

556
31:34.397 --> 31:35.737
Right, right.

557
31:35.737 --> 31:37.768
I'll apologize.

558
31:40.130 --> 31:42.160
Do you want me to do it now?

559
31:42.160 --> 31:44.199
Yeah, that would be best.

560
31:45.177 --> 31:46.548
Okay.

561
31:49.446 --> 31:51.057
Wait, I-I'll go out right now.

562
31:51.057 --> 31:52.494
Excuse me, just wait.

563
31:52.494 --> 31:53.745
Hey, you! What was that?

564
31:53.745 --> 31:56.577
Why are you giving her a whole new phone?

565
31:56.577 --> 31:58.797
I smashed her phone to bits.

566
32:06.450 --> 32:07.828
I'm...

567
32:11.763 --> 32:13.025
Well...

568
32:15.923 --> 32:16.947
Yeah.

569
32:16.947 --> 32:18.182
You can say it.

570
32:18.907 --> 32:21.670
About that time I dumped dirty water on you...

571
32:21.670 --> 32:23.363
I'm sorry.

572
32:23.363 --> 32:24.710
I really am.

573
32:26.303 --> 32:27.721
It's okay.

574
32:31.043 --> 32:32.573
It's fine.

575
32:33.550 --> 32:35.584
Thank you for apologizing.

576
32:38.063 --> 32:39.268
Me too.

577
32:44.037 --> 32:45.452
Hey, Kim Jin Mi.

578
32:46.310 --> 32:48.043
Come back out here for a second.

579
32:48.043 --> 32:49.463
Me?

580
32:49.463 --> 32:50.716
Again?

581
32:58.014 --> 32:59.060
T-This is...

582
32:59.060 --> 33:01.064
I'm not angry. I just want to know.

583
33:02.223 --> 33:04.318
Can you tell me...

584
33:04.318 --> 33:06.399
what's going on here?

585
33:16.411 --> 33:18.903
Sae Ryeong's place of residence...

586
33:18.903 --> 33:20.593
was all a lie.

587
33:21.683 --> 33:24.299
Turns out, it was some lawmaker's vacation home.

588
33:25.756 --> 33:28.696
You know, right? My dad's a lawmaker.

589
33:28.696 --> 33:30.410
A three-term lawmaker.

590
33:30.410 --> 33:31.847
Obviously...

591
33:31.847 --> 33:35.817
the owner of that house isn't Sae Ryeong's dad.

592
33:35.817 --> 33:38.630
She worked there and gained access that way.

593
33:38.630 --> 33:40.737
You should go now, Yu Gyeom.

594
33:40.737 --> 33:42.397
You head inside first.

595
33:42.397 --> 33:44.023
No, you go home first.

596
33:44.023 --> 33:45.347
No, you go ahead.

597
33:45.347 --> 33:46.751
Come on, you go ahead.

598
33:46.751 --> 33:49.037
- No, I'm fine. - Hurry up and go home.

599
33:49.037 --> 33:50.100
Go on.

600
33:50.983 --> 33:52.170
Okay, then.

601
33:52.170 --> 33:53.421
- I'll get going. - Okay.

602
33:53.421 --> 33:55.125
- She's poor in reality, - Bye.

603
33:55.125 --> 33:57.402
but pretended to be well-off.

604
34:03.750 --> 34:05.377
What the hell.

605
34:05.377 --> 34:07.137
Hey, did you see the thing?

606
34:07.137 --> 34:09.017
God damn it.

607
34:09.017 --> 34:12.343
She sure is a whole new type of crazy.

608
34:12.343 --> 34:13.390
What?

609
34:15.399 --> 34:16.832
Sung Sae Ryeong?

610
34:39.037 --> 34:40.567
You're here early.

611
34:43.770 --> 34:44.783
I am.

612
34:50.043 --> 34:51.768
Do you like rainy days?

613
34:51.768 --> 34:52.768
I do.

614
34:54.062 --> 34:55.615
"I do."

615
34:56.597 --> 34:59.390
Why? Do you not like the rain?

616
34:59.390 --> 35:00.485
Right.

617
35:00.485 --> 35:02.013
"Why? Do you not like the rain?"

618
35:02.690 --> 35:04.787
Don't most people?

619
35:05.817 --> 35:08.550
Everyone likes sunny days.

620
35:08.550 --> 35:10.080
Clear, sunny days.

621
35:10.787 --> 35:12.900
I like it.

622
35:16.670 --> 35:21.190
Clear days, rainy days, cloudy days.

623
35:30.817 --> 35:32.970
I like...

624
35:32.970 --> 35:34.340
all of them.

625
35:55.223 --> 35:57.306
Would you rather I only use sign language?

626
36:02.290 --> 36:03.720
Let's go eat something.

627
36:04.517 --> 36:05.810
What do you want to eat?

628
36:05.810 --> 36:07.144
Anything's fine.

629
36:19.097 --> 36:20.667
You should've said something.

630
36:20.667 --> 36:22.672
What foods do you like?

631
36:24.383 --> 36:25.590
That was too fast for me.

632
36:25.590 --> 36:27.689
I said, "What foods do you like?"

633
36:28.723 --> 36:30.132
I'm not picky.

634
36:31.491 --> 36:32.869
I see.

635
36:34.786 --> 36:36.163
What the hell is this?

636
36:36.163 --> 36:37.597
What do you mean?

637
36:37.597 --> 36:38.687
It's a karaoke place.

638
36:38.687 --> 36:40.070
Well, yes, so...

639
36:40.070 --> 36:41.681
So what am I supposed to do here?

640
36:41.681 --> 36:43.958
You'll be working reception, okay?

641
36:43.958 --> 36:47.379
Luckily for you, the owner offered good pay.

642
36:47.379 --> 36:48.448
Now...

643
36:49.163 --> 36:51.224
What do you mean, I'll be a receptionist?

644
36:51.224 --> 36:52.345
Hey.

645
36:52.345 --> 36:55.338
Didn't I tell you that I want to make a lot of money?

646
36:55.338 --> 36:57.202
So what's all this about working as a receptionist?

647
36:58.061 --> 36:59.855
You know...

648
36:59.855 --> 37:03.139
I can do other things, if you catch my drift.

649
37:03.139 --> 37:05.676
I want to work somewhere more...

650
37:05.676 --> 37:07.267
You know what I mean!

651
37:07.267 --> 37:08.460
Hey!

652
37:12.061 --> 37:13.808
You're eighteen years old.

653
37:13.808 --> 37:16.245
Eighteen, you weenie!

654
37:16.245 --> 37:19.535
If you want to sell your body that much, don't come asking us for work.

655
37:19.535 --> 37:24.010
If you really want to make money, go back to school and graduate first.

656
37:24.010 --> 37:26.754
You can then get hired by a company that'll pay you well!

657
37:26.754 --> 37:28.251
You're such a...

658
37:28.251 --> 37:30.978
You must be out of your mind if prostitution is your dream job!

659
37:30.978 --> 37:33.151
That's not something to dream about.

660
37:34.545 --> 37:36.058
Hey.

661
37:36.058 --> 37:38.962
This job is the best-paying one we got today.

662
37:38.962 --> 37:41.185
So shut it and work the front desk.

663
37:41.185 --> 37:43.755
Don't forget to give an extra 30 minutes to all the customers.

664
37:59.151 --> 38:00.778
What's wrong with you?

665
38:05.271 --> 38:06.987
I can't stand to watch.

666
38:09.445 --> 38:12.531
You know where Sae Ryeong is, right?

667
38:12.531 --> 38:14.061
Yeah, I do.

668
38:14.844 --> 38:17.145
Then can't we just go get her?

669
38:17.145 --> 38:18.532
We can't.

670
38:20.931 --> 38:23.569
Then we should go tell her grandma.

671
38:23.569 --> 38:26.913
We'll tell her that Sae Ryeong is okay, and give her your sister's number.

672
38:26.913 --> 38:29.131
We can do that, right?

673
38:29.131 --> 38:30.981
Sure. Let's do that.

674
38:35.114 --> 38:40.182
But she can't talk, can't hear, and I doubt she can text.

675
38:43.551 --> 38:46.475
What if I call your sister and relay it to--

676
38:46.475 --> 38:47.806
Ha Yeon.

677
38:50.518 --> 38:52.142
Does it bother you that much?

678
38:56.292 --> 38:58.056
Sorry.

679
38:58.056 --> 39:00.865
I just have no tolerance for these things.

680
39:01.765 --> 39:04.164
For all things pitiful.

681
39:04.164 --> 39:05.789
Why not?

682
39:09.971 --> 39:11.638
I see myself in them.

683
39:12.863 --> 39:16.529
I can't just walk past someone carrying heavy loads all alone,

684
39:17.505 --> 39:21.085
or someone being ignored.

685
39:21.085 --> 39:24.896
I can't sit by and watch someone cry at their desk all day.

686
39:27.198 --> 39:29.648
I see myself in all of them.

687
39:35.552 --> 39:37.638
I've...

688
39:37.638 --> 39:40.929
never been to Seoul, except for that time I went to look for you.

689
39:42.881 --> 39:45.435
I'm not saying we should go find Sung Sae Ryeong,

690
39:45.435 --> 39:47.549
or go visit my sister.

691
39:49.068 --> 39:50.515
What I'm saying is...

692
39:52.521 --> 39:54.152
I'll be going on a trip to Seoul with you.

693
39:54.152 --> 39:55.420
For the first time ever.

694
40:00.948 --> 40:01.985
Let's go now.

695
40:01.985 --> 40:03.295
To Seoul.

696
40:28.268 --> 40:30.355
How dare you!

697
40:31.068 --> 40:32.507
Did you just hit me?

698
40:34.055 --> 40:35.632
You touched me.

699
40:35.632 --> 40:38.123
Now I want to get paid. What's wrong with that?

700
40:38.123 --> 40:39.447
Wow, really...

701
40:39.447 --> 40:40.804
Where's the manager? Hey!

702
40:40.804 --> 40:42.455
I didn't request you.

703
40:42.455 --> 40:44.959
You're the one who barged in and got all up in my face!

704
40:44.959 --> 40:47.355
And you have the audacity to ask me for money?

705
40:47.951 --> 40:49.902
You touched me anyway.

706
40:49.902 --> 40:52.911
- You fondled me! - What's going on here?

707
40:52.911 --> 40:55.622
- What's the matter? - I want the manager.

708
40:55.622 --> 40:57.472
This lunatic just let herself in and--

709
40:57.472 --> 40:58.709
Excuse me?

710
40:58.709 --> 41:00.005
She did what?

711
41:01.101 --> 41:02.691
Seriously.

712
41:02.691 --> 41:04.221
I'm sorry about that.

713
41:04.964 --> 41:06.175
No, I'll go.

714
41:06.175 --> 41:07.585
I'll go right away.

715
41:07.585 --> 41:08.895
Okay.

716
41:11.137 --> 41:12.422
Dul Hee!

717
41:13.606 --> 41:14.764
What?

718
41:14.764 --> 41:17.717
That Sung Sae Ryeong kid is not right in the head!

719
41:18.817 --> 41:19.970
Ha Yeon.

720
41:21.551 --> 41:23.104
Yes?

721
41:23.104 --> 41:25.130
I want to ask you something.

722
41:33.368 --> 41:35.228
No, I don't want to!

723
41:35.228 --> 41:36.252
Hey!

724
41:36.252 --> 41:37.677
I should...

725
41:40.364 --> 41:41.612
You.

726
41:41.612 --> 41:43.819
Head back to your room.

727
41:43.819 --> 41:45.592
Now!

728
41:45.592 --> 41:46.725
Dul Hee.

729
41:46.725 --> 41:48.112
What should we do with her?

730
41:48.112 --> 41:49.749
We'll have to send her back.

731
41:49.749 --> 41:51.037
Is there anyone who can?

732
41:52.760 --> 41:54.066
Wait.

733
41:54.066 --> 41:55.651
I'll find someone.

734
41:57.351 --> 41:59.389
I should call your parents and...

735
42:00.539 --> 42:02.132
Right, you don't have parents.

736
42:02.132 --> 42:05.349
Whatever, surely someone will come get you.

737
42:05.349 --> 42:07.168
Go to your room and wait.

738
42:08.703 --> 42:10.885
Report us if you want. Go ahead!

739
42:10.885 --> 42:12.265
Screw it!

740
42:12.265 --> 42:13.981
I'll report you, too!

741
42:13.981 --> 42:15.212
Really!

742
42:15.212 --> 42:16.652
You're not like any other delinquent.

743
42:16.652 --> 42:18.716
You're truly something else!

744
42:21.555 --> 42:23.492
- What's up? - Hey!

745
42:23.492 --> 42:26.319
Great timing. Take her back to her room, will you?

746
42:26.319 --> 42:29.424
What? No, I'm busy. I can't.

747
42:32.385 --> 42:34.446
I guess I can.

748
42:35.232 --> 42:36.900
I'll just drop her off.

749
42:36.900 --> 42:37.915
Okay.

750
42:38.699 --> 42:40.239
Hey.

751
42:40.239 --> 42:42.279
She's underage.

752
42:42.279 --> 42:44.140
Don't even think about it.

753
43:29.922 --> 43:31.626
Hey, mister?

754
43:34.462 --> 43:36.535
Do you have any money?

755
43:36.535 --> 43:39.035
- What? - Have you got money?

756
43:39.035 --> 43:40.595
To pay me with?

757
43:59.462 --> 44:02.433
What? That's disgusting.

758
44:04.705 --> 44:05.736
Come here.

759
44:05.736 --> 44:07.842
She's pretty.

760
44:07.842 --> 44:09.495
Cute girl.

761
44:13.489 --> 44:14.679
It's okay.

762
44:29.135 --> 44:31.613
- What? - What? Go somewhere else!

763
44:31.613 --> 44:32.629
What?

764
44:32.629 --> 44:34.622
What did you say to us?

765
44:34.622 --> 44:36.406
- Hey, man! - How dare you!

766
44:36.406 --> 44:39.617
- You're nothing! - Go home if you're drunk!

767
44:41.605 --> 44:43.043
Die, you sly fox!

768
44:43.043 --> 44:44.259
- It hurts! - What are you gawking at?

769
44:44.259 --> 44:45.283
Hey!

770
44:45.283 --> 44:47.656
- What're you looking at? - Shut it!

771
44:47.656 --> 44:49.686
- It hurts! - Be quiet!

772
44:49.686 --> 44:51.457
- I said I'm sorry! - Same old, every day.

773
44:51.457 --> 44:53.580
Seriously, what's her issue?

774
44:57.820 --> 45:00.942
You bastard! What are you doing here?

775
45:00.942 --> 45:03.295
What's your problem?

776
45:03.295 --> 45:04.695
Excuse me...

777
45:05.589 --> 45:08.194
Why would you smack someone's head like that?

778
45:09.759 --> 45:12.070
Get lost, you piece of shit!

779
45:15.602 --> 45:16.833
That's your little brother?

780
45:16.833 --> 45:18.403
Why'd you hit me?

781
45:18.403 --> 45:21.007
Yu Gyeom, this place is bad.

782
45:21.007 --> 45:22.298
Let's report it to the police.

783
45:22.298 --> 45:25.909
Once we get Sae Ryeong back, let's just call the police on this place.

784
45:25.909 --> 45:28.939
Is today National Report to the Police Day or something?

785
45:28.939 --> 45:31.948
Yu Gyeom, people like these are lost causes.

786
45:31.948 --> 45:34.520
Violence is bad, right?

787
45:35.746 --> 45:37.962
Who's she?

788
45:37.962 --> 45:39.387
She's my girlfriend.

789
45:56.016 --> 45:58.119
Wasn't your girlfriend Sae Ryeong?

790
46:00.145 --> 46:02.937
Your girlfriend. I heard she's Sung Sae Ryeong.

791
46:02.937 --> 46:04.736
No.

792
46:05.615 --> 46:08.722
You're not even dating Sung Sae Ryeong, so why are you here?

793
46:08.722 --> 46:10.767
I just wanted to see what Seoul's all about.

794
46:11.782 --> 46:14.358
Must be nice to have it so easy.

795
46:15.362 --> 46:16.995
So is that...

796
46:17.935 --> 46:19.555
your girlfriend?

797
46:19.555 --> 46:20.650
Yep.

798
46:25.418 --> 46:30.855
You two are a damn perfect match.

799
46:33.748 --> 46:38.779
So what if we're a damn perfect match? It's my relationship.

800
46:38.779 --> 46:41.186
I'll date whoever I want.

801
46:41.186 --> 46:44.690
I just think you two are fucking ridiculous.

802
46:44.690 --> 46:47.391
What are you going to do about it?

803
46:50.668 --> 46:53.448
At least I don't stalk people like you do, sister.

804
46:53.448 --> 46:56.842
Remember that medical student who used to tutor you?

805
46:56.842 --> 47:00.911
You practically stalked him.

806
47:00.911 --> 47:04.193
Now that's fucking ridiculous.

807
47:07.682 --> 47:09.382
- Hey, miss. - Yeah?

808
47:09.382 --> 47:11.898
What are they saying?

809
47:13.215 --> 47:15.134
Let's see...

810
47:15.134 --> 47:16.152
Do you want to die?

811
47:16.152 --> 47:17.839
"You crazy bastard,"

812
47:17.839 --> 47:21.309
something about dirty water...

813
47:21.309 --> 47:22.726
"You should..."

814
47:22.726 --> 47:24.955
"know your limits."

815
47:24.955 --> 47:28.195
Yada yada. Basically, you shouldn't be dating.

816
47:28.195 --> 47:29.285
What?

817
47:30.431 --> 47:32.561
Let's see...

818
47:32.561 --> 47:35.153
Your boyfriend says,

819
47:35.153 --> 47:36.977
"Mind your own business."

820
47:36.977 --> 47:38.789
"Screw you."

821
47:38.789 --> 47:41.149
And she says...

822
47:41.149 --> 47:43.462
"You little bastard," and...

823
47:43.462 --> 47:46.374
In conclusion, she doesn't want you to date.

824
47:48.109 --> 47:51.173
Then I'll swear in sign language, damn it!

825
47:51.173 --> 47:53.383
My vocal cords are stuck together.

826
47:53.383 --> 47:56.584
How else am I supposed to swear?

827
47:59.530 --> 48:02.830
You're really lowering yourself.

828
48:04.934 --> 48:06.215
Who said you could call me that?

829
48:06.215 --> 48:08.789
Do I even need to keep going?

830
48:08.789 --> 48:12.675
It's all just "you jerk, you bastard, screw you, shut up," the full set.

831
48:12.675 --> 48:13.699
Miss.

832
48:13.699 --> 48:17.143
I thought sign language was graceful.

833
48:17.143 --> 48:18.535
Me too.

834
48:18.535 --> 48:21.220
I thought the same thing until I met her.

835
48:33.482 --> 48:35.570
You promise to pay me, right?

836
48:38.249 --> 48:40.842
You really are a virgin, right?

837
48:40.842 --> 48:42.139
Damn it, I said so, didn't I?

838
48:42.139 --> 48:43.681
Okay, okay. I got it.

839
48:43.681 --> 48:45.615
I'll pay, I will.

840
48:45.615 --> 48:46.662
How much?

841
48:46.662 --> 48:47.689
You...

842
48:47.689 --> 48:48.715
You're...

843
48:48.715 --> 48:50.706
You've done this before, haven't you?

844
48:50.706 --> 48:54.312
You seem alarmingly adept at this. You've done this before, haven't you?

845
48:55.276 --> 48:57.518
Just give me a million won.

846
48:57.518 --> 49:00.559
I'm lowballing you here, but only because I need the money.

847
49:00.559 --> 49:02.215
What the hell?

848
49:02.215 --> 49:03.421
A million?

849
49:03.421 --> 49:05.875
I can get a girl for two or three hundred thousand around here!

850
49:05.875 --> 49:07.202
Mister.

851
49:07.202 --> 49:08.840
I'm pretty.

852
49:12.055 --> 49:13.559
Show me the money first.

853
49:13.559 --> 49:15.124
Only then will I start.

854
49:18.322 --> 49:19.427
Okay.

855
49:49.246 --> 49:53.022
Are you just that brave?

856
49:53.022 --> 49:55.355
Or are you just dumb?

857
49:55.355 --> 49:58.085
I don't have to do what you ask.

858
49:58.922 --> 50:01.803
These streets are literally right up my alley.

859
50:03.509 --> 50:05.009
So, what now?

860
50:05.009 --> 50:06.964
Take your clothes off.

861
50:08.955 --> 50:11.255
If you want this money, at least.

862
50:17.589 --> 50:20.455
Hey, and everything comes off, okay?

863
50:20.455 --> 50:21.695
Everything.

864
50:24.789 --> 50:26.502
You see, I'm...

865
50:26.502 --> 50:30.004
legally recognized as having diminished capacity.

866
50:30.995 --> 50:33.013
So, if I just happened to get drunk and did some stuff to you,

867
50:33.013 --> 50:36.439
I'll just go to jail for a few months and that's the end of it.

868
50:37.602 --> 50:43.330
Which is why I've got balls of steel right now!

869
50:53.482 --> 50:55.249
You keep quiet, okay?

870
50:57.989 --> 50:59.318
Yeah, what's up?

871
51:03.735 --> 51:05.009
Hey.

872
51:05.009 --> 51:06.849
You better be naked and ready.

873
51:06.849 --> 51:08.487
Or I'll kill you.

874
51:12.042 --> 51:13.382
I'm listening.

875
51:15.002 --> 51:19.024
No, I dropped her off. I'm back home and about to go to bed.

876
51:20.475 --> 51:21.659
I'm not lying.

877
51:21.659 --> 51:24.593
I was just about to go to sleep.

878
51:25.375 --> 51:27.013
I'm serious.

879
51:27.013 --> 51:28.997
Why are you calling me? I'm about to sleep.

880
51:28.997 --> 51:31.015
I'm tired.

881
51:31.015 --> 51:32.800
I said I'm not!

882
51:33.886 --> 51:36.308
Hey! Damn.

883
51:39.766 --> 51:41.536
Damn it!

884
51:42.715 --> 51:46.102
Tell them to go through Kim Nam Jun's room.

885
51:46.102 --> 51:47.462
Yeah.

886
51:47.462 --> 51:50.931
Um, and check Sung Sae Ryeong's room, too.

887
51:50.931 --> 51:53.290
Then search every inn around here for all I care!

888
51:53.290 --> 51:55.751
They're both out of their minds.

889
51:55.751 --> 51:57.140
Damn.

890
51:57.851 --> 51:59.075
I'm hanging up.

891
51:59.764 --> 52:01.456
Dul Hee.

892
52:01.456 --> 52:04.140
It's been over an hour since Sae Ryeong and Nam Jun left,

893
52:04.140 --> 52:06.123
but neither of them is anywhere to be seen.

894
52:06.822 --> 52:09.273
You don't think something happened, do you?

895
52:23.415 --> 52:24.430
What?

896
52:42.333 --> 52:43.749
Damn it!

897
52:46.885 --> 52:48.415
Where the hell is she?

898
53:13.113 --> 53:14.459
How'd it go?

899
53:14.459 --> 53:15.777
Have you found them?

900
53:15.777 --> 53:16.828
No, we haven't.

901
53:16.828 --> 53:20.792
But the girls said Nam Jun took that Sae Ryeong girl to a motel,

902
53:20.792 --> 53:22.635
but she ran away.

903
53:27.009 --> 53:30.514
Hey, catch Kim Nam Jun and kill him!

904
53:31.693 --> 53:33.466
Which motel was it?

905
53:53.393 --> 53:56.102
I told you not to prey on minors!

906
53:57.366 --> 53:59.173
And even if she was an adult...

907
54:00.946 --> 54:03.760
you should just stay away from women!

908
54:03.760 --> 54:04.784
Stay back.

909
54:04.784 --> 54:06.121
- Put that down. - Stay away!

910
54:06.121 --> 54:09.578
- I'll kill you if you come closer! - Hey, put it down!

911
54:19.051 --> 54:20.906
Are you worried?

912
54:20.906 --> 54:21.956
No.

913
54:22.973 --> 54:24.493
Really?

914
54:24.493 --> 54:25.564
Yeah.

915
54:35.199 --> 54:37.990
How will we take Sae Ryeong with us?

916
55:12.673 --> 55:14.273
What's going on?

917
55:14.273 --> 55:15.753
Are you okay?

918
55:35.713 --> 55:37.203
- Hey. - Let go.

919
55:37.203 --> 55:38.587
- Let go of me! - Sung Sae Ryeong!

920
55:38.587 --> 55:39.719
Let me go!

921
55:39.719 --> 55:41.813
I said let go!

922
55:41.813 --> 55:43.636
Let go of me!

923
55:49.233 --> 55:50.763
Let go!

924
55:51.619 --> 55:52.792
Let me go!

925
55:52.792 --> 55:54.607
Please, stop this.

926
55:58.686 --> 55:59.710
Just stop.

927
55:59.710 --> 56:03.824
Why did I think that I could become a main character?

928
56:06.906 --> 56:10.240
Things like that never happen to me.

929
56:11.256 --> 56:12.449
Ha Yeon.

930
56:16.726 --> 56:19.246
On the train, Yu Gyeom asked me...

931
56:21.359 --> 56:23.994
if I'd go back home when summer break ended.

932
56:28.126 --> 56:29.510
And I...

933
56:33.826 --> 56:36.095
told him that I would.

934
56:40.346 --> 56:42.126
"Yes."

935
56:42.126 --> 56:44.845
"I'll go back to my normal life."

936
56:46.826 --> 56:49.886
"To my everyday life, where the real me belongs."

937
56:49.886 --> 56:55.490
"To my life, where I'm more like a kettle or a set of faded curtains."

938
56:55.490 --> 56:57.805
"So you should live yours, too."

939
56:58.659 --> 57:02.473
"That bright-red, vivid life of yours..."

940
57:02.473 --> 57:06.989
"where there isn't even a place for me to invade."

941
57:12.893 --> 57:15.076
"I hope you're happy."

942
57:16.436 --> 57:20.049
But these words never left my lips,

943
57:21.608 --> 57:26.274
and all I could tell him was, "Yes, I would go back."
